{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jer-13-1","title":"Jeremiah 13:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 By the type of a linen girdle, hidden at Euphrates, God prefigures the destruction of his people. 12 Under the parable of the bottles filled with wine he foretells their drunkenness in misery. 15 He exhorts to prevent their future judgments. 22 He shews their abominations are the cause thereof.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3405. B.C. 599. Go. 11; 19:1; 27:2; Eze 4:1-5:17; Heb 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-2","title":"Jeremiah 13:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>according. Pr 3:5; Isa 20:2; Eze 2:8; Ho 1:2,3; Joh 13:6,7; 15:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-3","title":"Jeremiah 13:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the word 3,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-4","title":"Jeremiah 13:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>go.Intending to point out, by this distant place, the country, Chaldea, into which they were to be carried captive.</p>\n<p>51:63,64; Ps 137:1; Mic 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-5","title":"Jeremiah 13:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>as. Ex 39:42,43; 40:16; Mt 22:2-6; Joh 2:5-8; Ac 26:19,20; 2Ti 2:3 Heb 11:8,17-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-6","title":"Jeremiah 13:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Arise. 2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-7","title":"Jeremiah 13:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>it was. 10; 24:1-8; Isa 64:6; Eze 15:3-5; Zec 3:3,4; Lu 14:34,35; Ro 3:12 Phm 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-9","title":"Jeremiah 13:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>After. 18:4-6; La 5:5-8 the pride. 15-17; Le 26:19; Job 40:10-12; Pr 16:18; Isa 2:10-17; 23:9 Eze 16:50,56; Na 2:2; *marg: Zep 3:11; Lu 18:14; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5 the great. 48:29; Isa 16:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-10","title":"Jeremiah 13:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>evil. 5:23; 7:25-28; 8:5; 11:7,18; 15:1; 25:3-7; 34:14-17; Nu 14:11 2Ch 36:15,16; Heb 12:25 walk. 7:24; 9:14; 11:8; 16:12; Ec 11:9; Eph 4:17-19 imagination. or, stubbornness. 3:17; *marg: Ps 78:8; Ac 7:51 shall. 7; 15:1-4; 16:4; Isa 3:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-11","title":"Jeremiah 13:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I caused. Ex 19:5,6; De 4:7; 26:18; 32:10-15; Ps 135:4; 147:20 for a name. 33:9; Isa 43:21; 62:12; 1Pe 2:9 but. 10; 6:17; Ps 81:11; Joh 5:37-40</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-12","title":"Jeremiah 13:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>and they shall. Eze 24:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-13","title":"Jeremiah 13:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I will. 25:15-18,27; 51:7; Ps 60:3; 75:8; Isa 29:9; 49:26; 51:17,21; 63:6 Hab 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-14","title":"Jeremiah 13:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>I will dash. 19:9-11; 48:12; Jud 7:20-22; 1Sa 14:16; 2Ch 20:23; Ps 2:9 Isa 9:20,21 one against another. Heb. a man against his brother. even. 6:21; 47:3; Eze 5:10; Mt 10:21; Mr 13:12 I will not. 21:7; De 29:20; Isa 27:11; Eze 5:11; 7:4,9; 8:18; 9:5,10; 24:14 but destroy. Heb. from destroying.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-15","title":"Jeremiah 13:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>and. Isa 42:23; Joe 1:2; Re 2:29 be. Isa 28:14-22; Jas 4:10 for. 26:15; Am 7:15; Ac 4:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-16","title":"Jeremiah 13:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Give. Jos 7:19; 1Sa 6:5; Ps 96:7,8 before. 4:23; Ec 11:8; 12:1,2; Isa 5:30; 8:22; 59:9; Am 8:9,10; Joh 12:35 your. Pr 4:19; 1Pe 2:8; 1Jo 2:10,11 while. 8:15; 14:19; Isa 59:9; La 4:17 the shadow. Ps 44:19 gross. Ex 10:21; Isa 60:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-17","title":"Jeremiah 13:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>if. 22:5; Mal 2:2 my soul. 9:1; 14:17; 17:16; 1Sa 15:11,35; Ps 119:136; La 1:2,16; 2:18 Lu 19:41,42; Ro 9:2-4 for. 15 because. 19,20; Ps 80:1; Isa 63:11; Eze 34:31; 36:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-18","title":"Jeremiah 13:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>unto. 22:26; 2Ki 24:12,15; Eze 19:2-14; Jon 3:6 Humble. Ex 10:3; 2Ch 33:12,19,23; Mt 18:4; Jas 4:10; 1Pe 5:6 sit. Isa 3:26; 47:1; La 2:10 principalities. or, head-tires.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-19","title":"Jeremiah 13:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>cities. 17:26; 33:13; Jos 18:5; Eze 20:46,47 shut. De 28:52; Job 12:14 Judah. 39:9; 52:27; Le 26:31-33; De 28:15,64-68; 2Ki 25:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-20","title":"Jeremiah 13:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>and. 1:14; 6:22; 10:22; Hab 1:6 where. 17; 23:2; Isa 56:9-12; Eze 34:7-10; Zec 11:16,17; Joh 10:12,13 Ac 20:26-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-21","title":"Jeremiah 13:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>wilt. 5:31; 22:23; Isa 10:3; Eze 28:9 punish. Heb. visit upon. for. 2Ki 16:7; Isa 39:2-4 shall not. 4:31; 6:24; 30:6; 48:41; Isa 13:8; 21:3; 1Th 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-22","title":"Jeremiah 13:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>if. De 7:17; 8:17; 18:21; Isa 47:8; Zep 1:12; Lu 5:21,22 Wherefore. 5:19; 16:10,11 the greatness. 2:17-19; 9:2-9; Ho 12:8 skirts. 26; Isa 3:17; 20:4; 47:2,3; La 1:8; Eze 16:37-39; 23:27-29 Ho 2:3,10; Na 3:5 made bare. or, shall be violently taken away.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-23","title":"Jeremiah 13:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Ethiopian. 2:22,30; 5:3; 6:29,30; 17:9; Pr 27:22; Isa 1:5; Mt 19:24-28 accustomed. Heb. taught. 9:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-24","title":"Jeremiah 13:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>will. Le 26:33; De 4:27; 28:64; 32:26; Eze 5:2,12; 6:8; 17:21; Lu 21:24 as. 4:11,12; Ps 1:4; 83:13-15; Isa 17:13; 41:16; Ho 13:3; Zep 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-25","title":"Jeremiah 13:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>thy lot. Job 20:29; Ps 11:6; Isa 17:4; Mt 24:51 because. 2:13,32; De 32:16-18; Ps 9:17; 106:21,22 trusted. 7:4-8; 10:14; De 32:37,38; Isa 28:15; Mic 3:11; Hab 2:18,19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-26","title":"Jeremiah 13:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>22; La 1:8; Eze 16:37; 23:29; Ho 2:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jer-13-27","title":"Jeremiah 13:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JER","chapterStart":13,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":13,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>thine adulteries. 2:20-24; 3:1,2; 5:7,8; Eze 16:15-22; 23:2-21; Ho 1:2; 4:2; 2Co 12:21 Jas 4:4 abominations. 2:20; 3:2,6; Isa 57:7; 65:7; Eze 6:13; 20:28 Woe. 4:13; Eze 2:10; 24:6; Zep 3:1; Mt 11:21; Re 8:13 wilt. 4:14; Ps 94:4,8; Eze 24:13; 36:25,37; Lu 11:9-13; 2Co 7:1 when, etc. Heb. after when yet? shall. Pr 1:22; Ho 8:5</p>"}]}